WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.630
NARRATOR: The caseworker
asks Desiree how she

2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.900
met Jay and what she knows about him.

3
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.520
DESIREE: Why does everybody do this?
We met online, okay?

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.260
That's how everybody meets people now.

5
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.470
He's not some creep.

6
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.400
He bought me this phone
so we can talk whenever,

7
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.960
because my foster mom takes mine at night.

8
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.980
He said I shouldn't
tell you guys about him.

9
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.460
He said you'd freak out
and try to keep me here.

10
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.240
Guess he was right.

11
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.860
(sighs) He's got a friend
who does modeling stuff.

12
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.840
He says I could make real money.

13
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.500
Way more than any program
is going to give me.

14
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.520
NARRATOR: Desiree has
told you more about Jay.

15
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.780
What do you notice,
and how do you respond?
